---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site, mailHref, telHref, whatsappHref } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Accessibility statement"
  path="/accessibility/"
  updated="30 October 2026"
  description="Our commitment to making the Apex Global website accessible, the standard we aim for (WCAG 2.2 AA), known limitations and how to contact us for help."
>
  <p>We want everyone to be able to use this website. We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.</p>
  <h2>What we have done</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Text and interactive elements meet at least 4.5:1 colour contrast.</li>
    <li>Every page can be used with a keyboard, with a visible focus indicator and a "Skip to content" link.</li>
    <li>The homepage background video plays without sound, can be paused, and is replaced by a still image if your device is set to reduce motion.</li>
    <li>All form fields have labels and clear error messages.</li>
    <li>The site works when zoomed to 400% and on screens from 320px wide.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Known limitations</h2>
  <p>
    The optional Google map and the Cloudflare Turnstile spam check are provided by third parties and may not fully meet WCAG 2.2 AA. You can always
    call, WhatsApp or email us instead.
  </p>
  <h2>Feedback and help</h2>
  <p>
    If you have difficulty using any part of the site, or need information in another format, call <a href={telHref}>{site.phone.display}</a>, message us on WhatsApp at <a href={whatsappHref} rel="noopener">{site.whatsapp.display}</a> or email
    <a href={mailHref}>{site.email}</a>. We aim to respond within five working days.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
